## Queue history

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

Received and merged bars represent different timestamps. Do not treat a merge spike as a sudden
increase in incoming reports. Preserve both events in future incident reviews.

## Triage change and follow-up

Use [proposed decision 0002](/kb/decisions/0002-evidence-before-merge) to replace subject-only
merging after the desk accepts it. Keep accepted decision 0001 intact as historical evidence.
Compare the mechanism, product, tenant configuration and reproduction; subject lines and intake
tags are clues. Keep unresolved reports separate until the evidence supports a merge.

The original issue drafts describe proposed checks. No production parser, booking form or mail system
was executed or repaired as part of this export review.

